imized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508740608","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99564#issuecomment-2508740608","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99564","id":2508740608,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ViFgA","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-29T23:55:57Z","updated_at":"2024-12-02T10:58:14Z","body":"I fixed all the problems, but now Git decided to torture me again...\r\n\r\nI typed:\r\n```\r\ngit commit --amend\r\ngit push --force\r\n```\r\n\r\nand got this:\r\n```\r\nfatal: The current branch get_connetion_count_method_graphedit has no upstream b\r\nranch.\r\nTo push the current branch and set the remote as upstream, use\r\n\r\ngit push --set-upstream origin get_connetion_count_method_graphedit\r\n\r\nTo have this happen automatically for branches without a tracking\r\nupstream, see 'push.autoSetupRemote' in 'git help config'.\r\n```\r\n\r\nI typed this `git push --set-upstream origin get_connetion_count_method_graphedit`\r\n\r\nand got this:\r\n```\r\nTo https://github.com/JekSun97/godot.git\r\n! [rejected] get_connetion_count_method_graphedit -> get_connetion\r\n_count_method_graphedit (non-fast-forward)\r\nerror: failed to push some refs to 'https://github.com/JekSun97/godot.git'\r\n```\r\nI updated the remote repository as well as the local one using `git pull --rebase upstream master`\r\n\r\nWhat magic can I perform to make Git love me again? 😞\r\n\r\nEdit:\r\nGit issue fixed with one command `git config --global --add --bool push.autoSetupRemote true`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508740608/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2511255467","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99564#issuecomment-2511255467","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99564","id":2511255467,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vrrer","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":